#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:13
#: 0ae5be0f063044a1803b5a0995c0d107 1c44f3a5dfd046da939511f9c976a9de
#: 887d260f72654309804c081f6f28ba37 b1c1324f61c949cf993890e348e4293f
#: dc586d4df129422f9120041f93c2b9b1
msgid ""
"MSP is the main communication protocol used by all Betaflight derived flight"
" stacks. It's a binary message based protocol used for control, telemetry "
"and sensors. ArduPilot's MSP protocol module is ported from Betaflight and "
"iNav, and supports both MSPV1 and MSPV2. It also supports iNav's MSPV2 "
"sensor messages for:"
msgstr ""
"MSP 是所有基于 Betaflight 的飞控固件所使用的主要通信协议。它是一种基于二进制消息的协议，用于控制、数传和传感器数据。ArduPilot "
"的 MSP 协议模块从 Betaflight 和 iNav 移植而来，支持 MSPV1 和 MSPV2，并支持 iNav 的 MSPV2 "
"传感器消息，用于："

