msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 用于 DJI FPV 或 RE 眼镜"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:35
#: 0c30ee3a741e48efa7798ebd7ea2a2af 3b5c5c6f192d4c81add6a48d027de7b1
#: 4aaec40e5151490b978eecc794754ab9 e30e5c40d8eb4a8a8bad2c26bf664d09
#: f29366358af344568b4e7e610376717e
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 is for sensors or generic MSP"
" telemetry usage"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 用于传感器或通用 MSP 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:36
#: 05c08478ec0f41e4b52c6f76f5620771
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 is for DisplayPort for DJI "
"goggle using wtf-os firmare, HDZero, Walksnail, or DisplayPort MWOSD."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 用于使用 wtf-os 固件的 DJI 眼镜 "
"DisplayPort、HDZero、Walksnail 或 DisplayPort MWOSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:38
#: 6ba6561e58284a95b10f2ab20d72f8f5
msgid ""
"There are 2 different DJI telemetery protocols to try to maintain "
"compatibility with DJI's evolving hardware."
msgstr "有 2 种不同的 DJI 数传协议，以尽量保持与 DJI 不断演进的硬件的兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:40
#: 0268bb0ba9444fac9ef2165d317b541c 10adaf54493e4de6a34688029ca65543
#: 51e6b5bb3fea4b0f9baa4f4176a17607 8752562b4c634f3d9432ba41ec669f8c
#: f6aedaae388b42e99fdae5b8a490eff2
msgid ""
"When :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 is selected the protocol"
" decoder can work in polling mode (default) or in \"telemetry push\" mode. "
"When working in polling mode, both TX and RX must be connected to the MSP "
"telemetry transceiver. While in push mode only the TX line is used. To "
"enable push mode, simply set :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\";"
" to disable set it to \"0\" (default)."
msgstr ""
"当选择 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 "
"时，协议解码器可以以轮询模式（默认）或「数传推送」模式工作。在轮询模式下，TX 和 RX 都必须连接到 MSP 数传收发器。而在推送模式下只使用 TX "
"线。要启用推送模式，将 :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位设为「1」；禁用则设为「0」（默认）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:42
#: 873c3af973e540c9bcde149f3fd3bcb2 8e658d5c27284ad5993ec1cf30ceac42
#: d6cc09e314484dd7bb901f2d3e9582b4 e98e140a2c3c494484806209c4d8dd41
#: ee5338cd9061447cb28c4c66c62f390c
msgid ""
"MSP sensors such as the Matek 3901-L0X are supported by both protocols."
msgstr "两种协议均支持 MSP 传感器，例如 Matek 3901-L0X。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:36
#: 20f6cf533394451abae84b57a1d067d2 3f0fe10608be4cd8b3054cc0c2f061f9
#: 6306545767f542b59497cd6587a8a1c5 d213a441bffa453eb81689fa89e752aa
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 is for DisplayPort for DJI "
"goggle using wtf-os firmware, HDZero, Walksnail, or DisplayPort MWOSD."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 用于 DisplayPort，适用于运行 wtf-os "
"固件的 DJI 眼镜、HDZero、Walksnail 或 DisplayPort MWOSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:38
#: 55e2fc9c71cf4db0ad7ef8261eeb762c 6f6de612a8a344838d5fbc9546e6c8b1
#: 7921dd8534054de1ac3a0c436a589a3f b50f72c041854aa8b4028e60a8e2fe27
msgid ""
"There are 2 different DJI telemetry protocols to try to maintain "
"compatibility with DJI's evolving hardware."
msgstr "为尽量兼容 DJI 不断演进的硬件，有 2 种不同的 DJI 数传协议可供尝试。"
